### 16. Environments

This is **very important** for professional development.

Instead of writing:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

everywhere, create a variable:

```text
base_url
```

with:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

Then use:

```text
{{base_url}}/students
```

Later:

```text
Development
    ↓
http://localhost:8000

Testing
    ↓
https://test-api.example.com

Production
    ↓
https://api.example.com
```

This is a professional Postman workflow.

